WEBVTT

00:22:25.336 --> 00:22:30.360
suggests that introverted leaders
actually deliver pretty great results.

00:22:30.384 --> 00:22:32.724
And the studies show
that the extroverted leaders,

00:22:32.748 --> 00:22:35.402
the charismatic ones,
tend to get paid more,

00:22:35.426 --> 00:22:38.219
but they're not necessarily
delivering better results.

00:22:38.243 --> 00:22:43.539
So one thing we've got
is a massive waste of potential,

00:22:43.563 --> 00:22:45.843
of people who could be
really effective leaders,

00:22:45.867 --> 00:22:48.710
because at the same time,
there's this data showing

00:22:48.734 --> 00:22:50.357
effective introverted leadership,

00:22:50.381 --> 00:22:54.209
there's a different pile of data showing
that introverts tend to get passed over

00:22:54.233 --> 00:22:55.498
for leadership positions.

00:22:55.522 --> 00:22:57.069
So, we're not using our talent.

00:22:57.093 --> 00:23:00.514
CA: Give me an example of two leaders
that people might have heard of